sequenceDiagram
    %% Every construct ADR 0009 adds to the sequence profile.
    autonumber
    actor user as End user
    participant web as Web app
    participant api as API
    Note left of user: Signed out
    user->>+web: Open dashboard
    web->>+api: GET /session
    Note over web,api: TLS 1.3, mutual auth
    api-->>-web: 200 session
    opt First visit
        Note right of api: Seeds defaults
        web-)+api: POST /events
        api-)-web: accepted
    end
    Note over web: Renders from cache
    web-->>-user: Dashboard
